#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.rst:2
msgid "HR"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres de Visualisation haute résolution :"
msgstr "Class containing high-resolution visualization settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:3
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:4
msgid "**Type** (:class:`ButtonGroup <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup>`) : Type de données à représenter (localisations ou suivi)."
msgstr "**Type** (:class:`ButtonGroup <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup>`) : Type of data to display (locations or tracking)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:5
msgid "**Source** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Source des données à représenter."
msgstr "**Source** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`): Source of the data to display."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:6
msgid "**Color mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : En cas de chevauchement, sélectionne si les valeurs des pixels sont additionnées ou si seule la valeur maximale est conservée."
msgstr "**Color mode** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`): In case of overlap, selects whether pixel values are added together or only the maximum value is retained."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:8
msgid "**Ratio** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Facteur d'agrandissement (par défaut : `4`)."
msgstr "**Ratio** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Magnification factor (default: `4`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:9
msgid "**Crop** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Supprime tout le cadre noir autour de la reconstruction (utile lors d'une reconstruction sur une partie du champ, conserve une marge de 5 pixels)."
msgstr "**Crop** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Removes the entire black border around the reconstruction (useful when reconstructing a portion of the field; retains a 5-pixel margin)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:11
msgid "**Remove Beads** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Supprime les billes lors de la reconstruction."
msgstr "**Remove Beads** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Removes the beads during reconstruction."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:12
msgid "**Drift Correction** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Applique une correction de la dérive (Remarque : les billes doivent avoir été extraites au préalable.)"
msgstr "**Drift Correction** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Applies drift correction (Note: the beads must have been extracted beforehand.)"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:14
msgid "**Smooth Drift** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Applique un lissage à la correction de dérive."
msgstr "**Smooth Drift** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Applies smoothing to the drift correction."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:15
msgid "**Gaussian** (:class:`HRGaussian <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.HRGaussian.HRGaussian>`) : Paramètres spécifiques à la représentation gaussienne."
msgstr "**Gaussian** (:class:`HRGaussian <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.HRGaussian.HRGaussian>`): Settings specific to the Gaussian representation."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:16
msgid "**3D** (:class:`HR3D <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.HR3D.HR3D>`) : Paramètres spécifiques à la reconstruction 3D."
msgstr "**3D** (:class:`HR3D <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.HR3D.HR3D>`): Settings specific to 3D reconstruction."

